  "steps": [
    "Cook the pulp with the sugar until it reduces to a gel. You need 130 g of it for the mousse.",
    "Melt the white chocolate with the butter, then mix in the yolks and 130 g of reduction.",
    "Whisk the whites with the sugar to a meringue, and whip the cream to soft peaks.",
    "Fold the cream, then the meringue, into the chocolate mixture.",
    "Spoon into glasses and chill. Top with the remaining reduction."
